  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺の仕事はこの近くの
鉱山で石炭を掘ることなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's my job to dig up coal
in the mines nearby.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>毎日毎日炭と汗にまみれて
真っ黒だ。だが、労働で、
わが毎日は充実だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Every single day, I get covered in
coal dust and sweat. Solid black.
It's real satisfying work, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺は石炭を掘る仕事をしている。
ここで掘られた石炭は
世界各地に送られている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My job's digging up coal.
The coal we mine here gets
shipped all over the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もし魔法文明が今以上に、
あまねく普及すれば石炭なんて
売れなくなるけどな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But if the "civilization of magic" disperses
further than it has now, no one'll
buy things like coal anymore.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺は鉱山で石炭を掘っている。
賃金は安いもんだ。
１日１００ガルド</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I dig up coal in the
mines. My wages are
low. 100 Gald a day.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アップルグミ１つ買うのも
大変なんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a big deal for me if I
use even a single apple gel.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273404</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>鉱山の仕事はとても危険だ。
いつ坑道が崩れるか、
わからないからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Working in the mines is very
dangerous. You just never know
when a tunnel will collapse...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273404</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、故郷の父ちゃん母ちゃんに
金を送るために
多少の危険は気にしてられないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I don't mind a little danger
if it means I can send some
money back to my ma and pa.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺は石炭を掘っているが、
ここの鉱山もそう長くはないと
言われているんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I dig up coal, but the mines
here don't have much left to
give, or so everyone's saying.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなったら、俺は
よその働き場所を探すだけだが
この村の連中は困るだろうな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In that case, I'll just have to find
some work elsewhere, but it'll be a
lot more difficult for these villagers.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>石炭の鉱山が涸れたその後から
金銀財宝ざっくざく……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once there's no more coal coming
from the mines, maybe they'll come
across some gold or silver, or...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見つかったら
いいんだろうけどな、
そんな上手い話はないよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, nice as that'd
be, life's not
often that kind.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この近くにある石炭の鉱山が
この村で１番の収入源に
なってるのは間違いないわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This village's number one source
of income is nearby coal mine
and it's not close, either, sweetie.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、今時、石炭なんて、
そうそう買い手もないしね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But there aren't a lot
of people looking to
buy coal these days.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱりこれからの時代、
魔法が文明の担い手ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sure enough, this is the
beginning of an era of
civilization founded on magic.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エルフかハーフエルフしか
使えないとは言え、人々は
重宝してるものね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Only elves and half-elves can
use it, but it's just so convenient
that that doesn't even matter!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村に住むバジルって学者は
人間でも魔法が使えるように
って考えてるらしいわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's a scholar, "Basil," who lives in this
village, and he seems to be thinking up
a way for humans to use magic, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことされたら、
私たちの商売上がったりに
なっちゃうんだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If that happens, we
sure won't be in
business, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……魔法が使えるように
なったら、石炭はいらなくなる、
石炭掘る仕事はあがったり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...If everyone can use magic, no one
will need coal anymore, so there
won't be any coal mining work...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、生活が豊かになるから、
あくせく働かなくてもいい……
あら？　意外とそれでもよくない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, our quality of life will go up, and
we probably won't even *need* to work,
so... Oh my... It might work out, after all?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジルさんが人間でも使える魔術
ってのを作ってくれれば
生活は豊かになるかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If Basil's able to create Magical Artes
that even humans can use, perhaps
our quality of life will go up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それでも私たちは
働くのよ、きっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But even so, I'm sure
we'll keep working.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>労働は尊いのよ？
たとえたくさんお金があっても
私たちは働き続けるのよきっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We take pride in our labor, you
know? Even if we had mountains
of cash, I'm sure we'd keep at it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしてかしらね……
あ、これがワーカーホリックって
やつかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder why that is...
Oooh, maybe we're what
they call "workaholics"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>村を開放したトーティス遊撃隊を
率いてた&lt;Cless&gt;ってあの
ヴァルハラ戦役の英雄だってね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, "Cless," who liberated the village, leader
of the Totus Mobile Task Force, right? I
hear he's also a hero of the Valhalla War.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラ戦役自体、古い話だし、
そんなヤツが今の時代に
生きてるなんて初めて知ったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Valhalla War is some old
history, so I had no idea that
dude was still alive even now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>トーティス遊撃隊ってのも
初めて名前を聞いたな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And it's the first time I've heard of
the Totus Mobile Task Force, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>調べてみたら、世界の各地で
地味に活動してるみたいだね。
この先、期待できるな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I looked into it, and they've been pulling
off some real impressive stuff, all over the
world. I've gt high hopes for those guys.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう言えば、この村自体、
もともと戦場跡に作られた
んだってね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Speaking of, I'm pretty
sure this village itself was
built on that battlefield.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦場の下に大量の貴重な鉱石が
眠っているなんて当時の人は
思いもしなかっただろうね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But they had no idea there
was a ton of precious ore
sitting right under their feet.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もともと石炭掘るために作られた
坑道だったんだってさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those mine tunnels were built
to mine for coal, originally.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなところから稀少金属が
見つかるなんて、本当にこの村は
運がいいんだからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This village is pretty damn
lucky to find such a rare
metal in a place like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>僕と一緒に穴掘りしてる
あのおじさん、
かなり手練の鉱山夫なんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This guy I'm digging with
is a dab hand at mining.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すごいよ、岩肌を触るだけで、
そこに原石が埋まってるのが
わかるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's incredible. Soon as he puts his
hands on a wall, he knows if
there's good ore behind it or not.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの人に弟子入りしようかな……
でも弟子は取ってないって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Should I try apprenticing to
him...? He told me he's not
taking on apprentices, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>僕は密かに彼の能力を
「ゴッドハンド」って呼んでるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've taken to calling
his talent the "Hand
of God," in secret.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>紅の月がこんなに取れる
鉱床など、このアセリアの
どこを探してもないぞよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ain't nowhere in Aselia
you can dig up this
much Crimson Moon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界の鉱山を渡り歩いた
この鉱山夫の神である
私が言うのだから間違いない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm a top-tier minin' man who's
been to mines across the world,
so if I say it, you can bet on it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確か北の方とモーリア近辺にも
ほんの少しだけ、この紅の月が出る
場所があったはず</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, there's certainly some spots
you can find just a smidge of Crimson
Moon, up north or near Moria.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、本当に少しだけだ。
こんな大量に出るところは
珍しいぞよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it really is just a smidge.
It's real unusual to find a spot
that's got this much of it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>紅の月ってのは
人工マナの原材料らしいぞの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seems this Crimson Moon's a
material for makin' artificial mana.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、それが何に使われてるか、
そんなことには正直、
あまり関心はないぞよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What anyone else uses it
for has got nothin' much
to do with me, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は見つけることが生き甲斐だ。
見つかったものの行き先などは
どうでもいいのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm just happy to find the
stuff. Wherever it goes from
here, I don't care either way.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見つけるまでが、我らがロマン、
金になるとかならないとか、
そんな野暮なことは言いっこなし！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But lookin' for it? That's what I live
for. Don't be some lout who goes
straight to askin' how much it's worth.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一緒に採掘している
あの若者が私に
弟子入りしたがっておる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That youngster excavatin'
with me keeps askin' if
he can be my apprentice.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゴッドハンドとか呼びおるのだ。
その呼び方はなんだか不吉だから
やめよと言うとるのだが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's callin' me the "Hand of God,"
even. I feel like it'll bring me bad
luck, so I told him to quit it, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は一匹狼だ。
誰かを弟子に取るとか
そういうのはしたくない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm a lone wolf. I don't
want to take on any
apprentices or nothin' like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の術は誰かに引き継がれたり、
するものではないのだぞよ、
単なる勘なのだから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And this skill of mine's not
somethin' I can pass on, besides.
It's just my intuition, y'see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
